c.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134601316,imgsize-381530.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Gadkari announces Rs 1,176 cr 6-lane bridge over Teesta]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gadkari-announces-rs-1176-cr-6-lane-bridge-over-teesta/articleshow/134600035.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134600035.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a major development, the Indian government has greenlit funding for the construction of a bridge over the Teesta river in Darjeeling, set to strengthen connections between Sikkim and North-Eastern states as well as the vital Siliguri Corridor. Alongside this is an expressway from Gorakhpur to Siliguri, promising to enhance regional collaboration and economic progress.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gadkari-announces-rs-1176-cr-6-lane-bridge-over-teesta/articleshow/134600035.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gadkari-announces-rs-1176-cr-6-lane-bridge-over-teesta/articleshow/134600035.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T23:14:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dipak K Dash</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134600137,imgsize-79870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cabinet clears Rs 1,789cr intelligent traffic system for Delhi, first planned before 2010 CWG]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cabinet-clears-rs-1789cr-intelligent-traffic-system-for-delhi-first-planned-before-2010-cwg/articleshow/134599851.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134599851.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Union Cabinet has approved a Rs 1,789 crore Intelligent Traffic Management System project for Delhi. This project will feature AI-enabled traffic signals and real-time congestion detection across key corridors. The system aims to enhance traffic management by integrating existing signals, CCTVs, and AI technology. It will improve the movement of emergency vehicles and assist in identifying traffic violations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cabinet-clears-rs-1789cr-intelligent-traffic-system-for-delhi-first-planned-before-2010-cwg/articleshow/134599851.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cabinet-clears-rs-1789cr-intelligent-traffic-system-for-delhi-first-planned-before-2010-cwg/articleshow/134599851.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T22:54:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dipak K Dash and Raj Shekhar Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134599851,imgsize-285378.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Govt invites global mining majors to first India Mining Week in Nov]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-invites-global-mining-majors-to-first-india-mining-week-in-nov/articleshow/134599688.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134599688.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In November 2026, India is set to host its inaugural India Mining Week, aiming to foster global engagement and investment in the mining sector. This significant event will spotlight policy advancements and the discussion of essential minerals, featuring a high-profile conference, various exhibitions, and dialogues on mining technology and sustainability.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-invites-global-mining-majors-to-first-india-mining-week-in-nov/articleshow/134599688.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-invites-global-mining-majors-to-first-india-mining-week-in-nov/articleshow/134599688.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T22:44:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Atul Mathur</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134599755,imgsize-72866.cms"/></item></channel></rss>